fix(runtime): Safely extract short IDs from UUIDs for agent naming
scale: ~33 lines across 1 files [S]

- `runtime.rs`:
    - Introduced `short_id_from_str` helper function to safely extract the first segment of a string (up to the first hyphen) or the first 8 characters if no hyphen is present. This replaces a `.split('-').next().unwrap()` call, preventing panics if a UUID string unexpectedly lacks hyphens.
    - Modified agent naming logic in `AgentFleet::tick` to use `short_id_from_str` when generating agent names from UUIDs.
    - Added unit tests for `short_id_from_str` to verify correct behavior with standard UUIDs and hyphen-free strings.

